  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 302.03 Matching State Funds. Except for nonqualifying organizations, grant awards of state funds shall require a minimum of 50% matching funds from private sources.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36",
